{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10001_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a792f98b7b9cb6ad834fd4aabcca39269d595946c57363d7ee95feec12054936",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f18fa4d05369196d972d1f648d5b67e6af6d0401b2bb70f8e342a8b327171de4",
      "text": "改变世界的组合",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ed2a98b78d1d68706ab790287cb814b031edec9054643260e9ed9feb050dccd",
      "text": "作为踏上“JAPAN IDOL FES”舞台的一环，\nC.FIRST决定制作演唱会舞台影像。\n以“破开黑暗的骑士”为概念选定了服装与歌曲，\n全员各自为拍摄展开了准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f18fa4d05369196d972d1f648d5b67e6af6d0401b2bb70f8e342a8b327171de4",
      "text": "改变世界的组合",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1fb86f4e4cca639680527fc2debc9a144a80940550158c3e22fa3583d423caf",
      "text": "秀先生、百百人先生、锐心先生。\n把各位召集过来不是为了别的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79adcc0c8ed5b9bca26b28607c0d2f5eb4539cc4f7b4d7626914933997542a67",
      "text": "为了向偶像业界宣传\n我们315 Production的存在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b737dd5a530f55eb064026868f01147d0aef5bc6453a7684f671140bb4c23882",
      "text": "我们决定制作一部\nC.FIRST的演唱会风格宣传影片！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f32d1ab7f182ab9b2b947c9eaf28a26fdcf8adc1416941fce206748aea3d3f59",
      "text": "……哼～。所以，这就是企划书？\n能让我看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51eb797b79fd036df84c728b38916396ab16fcfeeda4209bba55d8f6f50cd7f2",
      "text": "嘿，邀请业界相关人士来看现场演出并进行拍摄啊……\n会场规模是……服装设计是……嗯、嗯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea191911e98bd20b1b00dbe57f879787f44d8d7f401d2a6578dc5c2a9d3e26f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。企划的意图我是明白了，\n但为什么选了我们？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:151d31058845000e7a7c9d346fc1e957086f1952608ce8baeeadbfe19b1afcbc",
      "text": "要宣传315 Pro的话，说实话，\n我觉得有其他更合适的组合吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e61f7f75c0076b5124d0b9198f614c73afce05e718253ff995033cc545f35f9",
      "text": "正是因为我们的技能还不成熟，才会选我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1f6ffc2d16d4c6de0489264f454b7f4be36972992e9b8a6961b8c412877c373",
      "text": "正如你所言，315 Pro里\n精通这类拍摄与公关宣传的人不在少数。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2d4f8dd2d592bfabc7a6b10888cf002b4ad1bd2f04ff7a70dbea477cd0401d2",
      "text": "但我们还很不习惯。\n强化这方面的能力也是目的之一吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e44a38b5cccee7f29d68b2ebf5c5dd8dd6f87dc59d0356058ffd998be506064b",
      "text": "是的，正是如此。我希望各位能通过这次拍摄，\n积累全新的经验！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b644a2c05abdac06491ee8e092d32dc4b44aa3768ca3b750490a181ddd0daad9",
      "text": "既然是这样，那这份工作我就欣然接受了。\n就让他们见识见识所谓C.FIRST的演唱会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_a:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b471df023f562d6033696640622e45aab81934b0fac3256b2f2a100aa81c32e",
      "text": "嗯♪ 为了不辜负\n●●●●●●●●●●P酱的期待，我会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f0be371c56ef4864cfb9cc85dbb0894b865d64d0026a90f26ea68bf83747650",
      "text": "演唱会的概念是\n“破开黑暗的骑士们”吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203a82dda88a147e941c398f81cdc174c26c0358ddfe2bcb75e7d650aa02511b",
      "text": "这套服装，是●●●●●●●●●●P酱\n为我们准备的对吧。谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1e6c5f69352994a41cadabcb8d87979f1966074ecd5e83d04d88b5a9104c3ed",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。这份文件里\n没有说明，舞蹈的编舞现在是什么情况？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baa25799d5d71206268b3448a07d6bbca576bb7a48387490aab583617a91d2c0",
      "text": "预计这几天内，就会连同歌曲音频数据\n一起把视频参考资料交给各位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f8980cf905365f3b7694875fa0d271d5ef048d781711e371d22a2bc1a3602de",
      "text": "明白了，那就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81d5658cb57ea04a1fef2d7e5f7409aef9c7ab47a2ee4c4a7dbad8bef4c37c58",
      "text": "（……观众主要是“业界相关人士”吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e42d262bd216f669fe7cd280a77379be0e387f1d6f46ee6b217397211b5efc4a",
      "text": "（现在的自己成为偶像的时间还很短。\n无论是工作经验，还是课程训练的经验都十分匮乏）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9bf5f55a2506fe273b708d40c4236c5788126541f4fa8739c63a5245d6ae5cb",
      "text": "（正因如此，这会是一个衡量自身素质的好机会吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d7b40a4250a288f6464846ed7f9a93567c38cfb1b7589665e9f1bf80dd93983",
      "text": "……呐，P酱。我一定会成为\n配得上这套服装的帅气骑士给你看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29e1329d318421f6cef6bce3caab0c262ac7d03e5e2dbf27564d94e058aa258e",
      "text": "啊啊。我保证会呈现出\n不辱这一概念的舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_b:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0a05ca21e83f8304f2d59335148c148c631bb1921fc3226343d76a70ac09116",
      "text": "这种程度的事我轻轻松松就能搞定。\n所以你就把心放宽吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:483747f07be108261a7e150c2c83e5f5d127e7c2c2c1b079e15468e3e462ce71",
      "text": "不得了……我们的新歌，完成度超出想象啊。\n再听一遍吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d22d494af9495462fe0325cf1ddf93e5e707f4753c953f92758289f8da057a8b",
      "text": "……从B段接入副歌的地方，感觉特别棒。\n力量感很强，跟歌词非常契合。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e3d9e1093c25953aa795d1ba2074694f0aa28b61b043b2966c93f44c3166522",
      "text": "话说唱Demo的人，声音真好听啊……\n嘿，原来这里是这么唱的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ba7467143f8478cb2486cd89210f641aeecc59b0226f8ec77752aa8badcebed",
      "text": "……我自己也试着唱一遍看看吧。\n啊——、啊——……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a172ddf6500a0a51ba4db494f0eef98b93850ecca13291681bc3d0e9b12cee1a",
      "text": "（哇……太棒了吧！\n这首歌的分词会是怎样的呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a2a3c57d63cfbb0e35923db5723b15b4f3e692e81fa3c2fb5dad0674f25d0e7",
      "text": "（要是和前辈们一起唱，会变成怎样的音乐呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ab924dca58aa17594f811133fbe8313628a007affe573202e68e0b9e9e9f4be",
      "text": "（如果大家的歌声能够完美契合在一起，\n感觉绝对会超级爽的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4af2206bd420511286f5c2ba2547047210af776094e9cdc4f77776c6f6fe1b9e",
      "text": "……嗯，这一定会成为一首好歌。\n多唱几遍，稍微提升一下熟练度吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f73db182450f5b0b006f6b9c365fc6eeeb4c7fc8362291e6ad541f3969a0e380",
      "text": "呼啊……早啊。\n……咦？●●●●プロデューサー就你一个人？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:450325074d31da2d866d29726b7d5038f9301cb1a662656949c9b2a82fe05309",
      "text": "早上好。是的，就我一个。\n秀先生看起来好像很困呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6531b9bd191e4a1ff8cb6966da86e1d1f432cc782c7bf0aa1629a215b3a50ce9",
      "text": "有点困吧……呼啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e8b6ad01f0a8ea232e04ca4c9cf78c8c6deca2bf02de9ee82c74cd4a6dd175c",
      "text": "（练得太投入导致没怎么睡这种事，太丢脸了\n说不出口……喝杯咖啡提提神吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e044a88e2111fee6126d6f98b505305778cb9e06df75b4319b3298f9400bcb97",
      "text": "给，请用。\n想着你肯定也要喝，就泡了两人份端过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17ab2ce57e8acff83b42045eeaaeed5e10c465d35e5c564dec28893c1e0bf19c",
      "text": "啊，特意泡给我真是太不好意思了！\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39d78af76cffce9488f3ef11c5c3093ed426c7bec9663d515c9dae7fc522bfcf",
      "text": "不用客气。\n百百人前辈和锐心前辈还没来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f240692e27997abb82405e04a789a5baebbd4d523483a259d1323734e84c8a2b",
      "text": "百百人先生说有想要确认的事情，\n已经先去练习室了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edec05e833e171682dc2db1c4bd0d9f18f7e4da3899d0d8891b7d07d8a4d1613",
      "text": "锐心先生的话，我想应该差不多快到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8c2c23445f367f4e2777ede879f860ef0885af238a6d613f5996768fc531e4",
      "text": "哼～……虽然离训练开始还有5分钟。\n没想到锐心前辈是那种卡点才到的人啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f1e43c42d26285ae477ebd561d7a80431cf96f4b46921beb24cac9c37446fc",
      "text": "那时，锐心正……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:469f4b22f79d739e95e6293aab5d1e33ff3da864479adac932857f2abb845e10",
      "text": "眉见宅邸",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6601142b8b37eaadbc2ea65a2bc8f5c1335081e5d3babab4a8dfc22d4f30bc",
      "text": "1、2、3、4……\n呼，差不多就是这样了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f8de22c416a24737ba8200bf587dad0e316ff8a36b94f64f79a84922099dacc",
      "text": "（感觉已经掌握得差不多了。\n细节部分等正式练习时再调整吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff5684d3533214209129d29ed6a69e4100a08f4dcd72ed0b6be7a13ebf0e5b0e",
      "text": "最后，再把秀和百百人的走位也\n记一下吧。……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000058:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06272b7f481e462932928402fe0f12f2119475f7054d73eedde38807d87be0ff",
      "text": "翌日清晨……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abcd1062a905c06394e279a5441eeea0ec3847dac53da3a219882cbd232b0102",
      "text": "呼啊……嗯。\n我怎么会在家庭影院里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a91219a7298b9cc82c5ffa723318b8914de2cc090b9166dc4dffab53a3c8e307",
      "text": "（啊啊，是这样啊。\n昨天不知不觉就这样睡着了啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:807397f4c8a1adfd48dc68dcd1bcc638df92f66fff39efc59cd1cd3242744988",
      "text": "……！？已经这个时间了吗！？\n糟了，学生会的晨会要……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000109:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15646b13b9f99fca4055ea9f9c4e7c45f92d5400293db167ef0ac2ecf5690da",
      "text": "放学后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b84536dad0335c0eac571019ebb0b615f1177880a06e02ffb0fca5fba7fd612e",
      "text": "（虽然从早上开始就手忙脚乱的，\n不过总算是赶上练习了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aec2f529887f276a2f89a9ca914df3d1b8e246bc408d4d55244de383a4dfca1",
      "text": "早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d94c0a6b798de39b5632b1923c2178a44279b9c94ed80d88cd4b4501861bb4",
      "text": "啊，说曹操曹操到……早上好。\n话说，锐心前辈，你的头发翘起来了一点哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2296bb054432bf7425e26c672cd2024db491b6cd99e09b68656f575e80ee1ca8",
      "text": "忘记做造型了吗？真少见呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_e:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f37f13ad7692150c84b2249826974ffd8764f9e33f1d744ce12d6315ac711b9f",
      "text": "……原来如此。在学校里每次跟人擦肩而过\n对方都一脸惊讶，是因为这个原因吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef2804dc4c8c76d96fff049978bf43b306575714b18f15c3a2053682c9a15cc",
      "text": "一个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24f4fb833781e4d02edd129f579322c4f2b39d8d2166408da1ac751e6d12b47c",
      "text": "接下来从副歌开始吧。\n1、2、3、4！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80f8f82d99f5b77f14dc21b6375a27a54f75abe30fe4f0638a130d6d4cd6f033",
      "text": "（咦、奇怪……？\n唱歌和跳舞越来越脱节了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de80a65c1e15964e2c71e3c49920de390a4217cf824b48829014ed55f8a30e40",
      "text": "唔——舞蹈动作稍微慢了点呢。\n再来一……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bf35f10d05c86e3f33612984af74c0271dc3f856f21978207e9e4d1e3242aed",
      "text": "我可以的，拜托请再来一次！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e97026db5c0afa81eacf1ec0d70ebfe516551c96516ccb7b77c4904e5f1de602",
      "text": "不需要休息一下吗？\n既然这样……好，1、2、3、4！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df34cb6a9303e0b2a33c3d9957469e12e7542084a8c04f535b4ce15a126678a5",
      "text": "（啊……又失误了。\n这次音准偏了，舞步也没合上）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:043df3f8d90f8e59a3fd7770f286fc95de03594973b7753a1a9daf1432ceeec2",
      "text": "那、那个！请再来一次……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3ea9e2cd639541c7c2c2f486a9eb76780db08898e0ddfbb2f40de4832517371",
      "text": "不，先休息一下吧。虽然你每天一个人\n练习好几个小时，但练过头了也不好哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ef167267ad003ba50ab08a32fc3d1a1f0b460161252014df8df68ff9736f6ba",
      "text": "是、这样啊。\n诶嘿嘿，我明白了。……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_f:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34d1e45eb7eab6ae60e2c1b8c3160a0a611395f572059beefb1fb2214b263e7b",
      "text": "为什么我就是做不好呢。\n明明比大家练习得都要多……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5abae24b1c657ea5ea4cc95d2945c8c18419180208ec320008005757d67bb740",
      "text": "（天峰君唱歌那么好，\n眉见君跳舞那么棒……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7362a2888216d7ee93be72aa02146c7390766c3f8ad81f866fd92983518e1f6",
      "text": "（……可是我，却连一样都做不好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e427dd35ffd3699a4f8e54f7479aa398854e9d216862d2c8bbff4699d2c5167b",
      "text": "（一旦专注唱歌，舞蹈就会疏忽。\n小心注意着这点了，又会在别的地方出错）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:752da60a1615a9f357ad550ae1f199f23af4a32d7a8c9ae65d6b10f845959959",
      "text": "（为什么无论做多少次都没有进步呢？\n再这样下去，会被P酱抛弃的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1518bf8283f0107da6c69f72dfc3e03e50477e2afcf49b9654570e897d38b3cb",
      "text": "早上好……咦？\n百百人前辈，你怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a95a69ca25cb2b96f3dbb4a804a26d98d3a5ac6bcf4b7a69bba1f29e0fbbb33d",
      "text": "啊……天峰君、眉见君。\n●●●●●●●●●●P酱也来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6ff13103829355503ba2fb7eeb2b1d54cbf0486aa529b1f375e51d06152e446",
      "text": "……发生了什么？说出来听听。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ba29940db7903933b09b872f622c059a1bc3f699d239859c5f4e3970ff2cbf2",
      "text": "我、我在唱歌和跳舞上稍微有点烦恼。跟学校的考试\n不一样，当偶像想要拿100分真的好难啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a1d035843fde98b5c187b65c9eca6c1f641a9a79f1dff70d4bfd276ed9f61ca",
      "text": "（明明付出了这么多的努力。\n难道我真的没有当偶像的才能吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45c9045970904e8c93c65dc7e5a7cc865e95fac8efcc364faee22fded348ecc3",
      "text": "（我不要这样。好不容易才被发掘出来的。\n如果不能作为偶像活下去的话，我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:549f2641715b598489a3c000b09174d5c907cd90fba38b577021a30e2d836eec",
      "text": "百百人先生不是一直以来，\n都在付出100%的努力吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b3010cbe86229ad291c164e080f6bd2f46279a73285d1a35f72d5e3d66e16a",
      "text": "这可不是谁都能轻易做到的，\n仅凭这一点，就已经是100分满分了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e",
      "text": "诶……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad93892e32ab8e2645bb81d9b3b2c361931e247359fe405e43295822a36fd698",
      "text": "哼～。●●●●プロデューサー，\n拿个100分你就满足了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fee2e7baba9b79e42bd323208f2462ed7130f6628dc93ebb56597e354d2162f",
      "text": "如果是我们3个人的话，我觉得就算拿1000分也不在话下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_g:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0c90be7c53b4a254ac423bd57e79b26e4e064017bf66b894dc2ac79e16bf4fc",
      "text": "确实。没有必要非得一个人拿100分。\n3个人一起拿100分，甚至去争取1000分就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e7df21d6c6728199ebe26ca0935a30000336443695128bfd35b8f6ecaa27858",
      "text": "所以百百人，不要一个人拼命。\n3个人应该齐心协力……话虽如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:206f2aad9b4db4f3376df677ab721c090abc27f0bb558a0128c978dfdbc4cdb8",
      "text": "“不想被人看到自己狼狈挣扎的模样”，\n这种心情我也能理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe6ecacc51427557eed63d092f7e60d651435929de8b4fa0050a7a7bf8f53003",
      "text": "我也是这样。一直在家里独自一人\n练习唱歌和舞蹈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41b7fac3307cf3f6a3e815362698a54e2057eacf0339940e9327871ecca10573",
      "text": "什么嘛，锐心前辈也是？\n我也在家里反复听歌加练呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:021b131ece945d04e518ee1b5da65811a915946c89b9d10bf471e1bed3299068",
      "text": "诶……但、但是，完全看不出来你们有在偷练啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a902845ee5766a439e3b640c601c8050e5c1cb85dfb91be7ac1a911c3933581d",
      "text": "这个嘛，毕竟……\n不想被别人发现自己在偷偷加练嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6073b59616fe5ef1185f94edeb493637dc20c5f688153798cc72e43af5fd38",
      "text": "不过，为了把C.FIRST的演唱会办好，\n拼命也是理所当然的吧。虽然我本来不想说出来的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc7b9be447e3faeb29f3cfe5d958f1811f338821c86200ceb6ee55c801d75b49",
      "text": "（什么嘛……原来不只是我一个人啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c49ee9095a917dc735d1e32de1ca4d61b250a2a7b7e1b4eb27783130ce3279",
      "text": "呵呵，原来我们都是同一种人呢。3个人都在\n耍帅，背地里却一个人偷偷努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7f3f969d32fdf44648294f408adc3a128ff057ce21191552e0f9e7be93db23f",
      "text": "呵，看来确实是这样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2698c575ad8329e03ad6dc993d027b9c5e737ae3138ecc8e6885dc381d14b18f",
      "text": "……要想改变世界，\n我们自己也必须做出改变才行吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53e151b99059a81242e08d7ab3f8926d824029f538a00bd9c6b556bd76e50541",
      "text": "前辈们。能不能把手借我一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c7e7d932af45c9760790822eb28a78753cc218a3c9ed2bd8532865f381044bf",
      "text": "？像这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68cecb68df2b50008aa640477d0f0c24d8fe508dc5c16e77b9ae06d03f737967",
      "text": "对对。然后，像这样叠在一起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:867c1694df96088aed51e058ef931ea3ba34c99c35ac51cdea79c3b3fc1400ea",
      "text": "这次的演唱会，把我们3人偷偷苦练的成果全部展现出来……\n用C.FIRST，让偶像业界大吃一惊吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fd12f47afd16e858faa2d6e1e66ea9c9beef3067facddeb59909e45f77ccb02",
      "text": "……嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000190:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83a0a12181fb07977cb38651346f872073dd843995907d3e4bbf378f9cca5077",
      "text": "演唱会前夜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8b77792d4172b41c34a489375d3fa7cdff99c82a39a11d4dd20b489c686bc8",
      "text": "……啊，●●●●●●●●●●P酱？\n这么晚了还打电话给你，对不起哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000200:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15b19320d3952ac25230132404728b185f473072f8db4c2fb7c277209ad33e74",
      "text": "明天终于要迎来正式演出了呢。一想到\n这件事，我就忍不住想听听你的声音。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000202:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c85cb91b6ab4e3c6ea582694c42f7ec47adb318b9984d261a6799265c4b0f90",
      "text": "我可能有点紧张了。\n能陪我稍微聊一会儿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000204:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d343ca896cf656862d861688fd5198331ffd14c267246db044a087c376951e73",
      "text": "没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000206:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b436b38f345ae44ed45ca1152e9b1542908f8462469333d3bc144d9ede71e28",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n只要听着P酱的声音，我就会安心下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000208:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc4cb61d38b7ddd0de97cf241959eaf761299c093513bb809c136692dafd146a",
      "text": "我本以为自己已经习惯站在人前了，\n心跳却还是扑通扑通跳个不停。感觉好不安啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000210:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a25d79e9e6c12db9f655b7185cf390ce453b7256475b530e8018a563f487242",
      "text": "秀先生和锐心先生，\n还有我都会陪着你的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000213:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:821b1cab6cfc912c73bdaa912a9747a4e1c67ec5cebdb5cd31b26761423e3804",
      "text": "……是、这样呢。我身边还有大家，\n还有●●●●●●●●●●P酱陪着我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000215:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4695a73af9512f1b35a4dd415806ac632f084794f499cc411611d96c212f3e61",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱所期待的我，\n我会在演唱会上展现给你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000217:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39d6c5405e98f591af17faa0b18adf419fd8126257592ad17111557c1fc0aca5",
      "text": "明天，敬请期待吧。\n那么，晚安啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000228:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8baaf658ff78956e48e10b959e3874e2a0e5156af85a4de7a5ee4d0e0e3fbc9",
      "text": "天峰君、眉见君，\n明天的演唱会一起加油吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000230:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9651974dd46b4b0b61191e0de4bfcb9428141bf41b768751e920af2780cd7e7",
      "text": "那是当然的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000232:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d7bb294d450a709df3fec8cbd7ceae91133e0e5472347cd1bc5da5bd884abeb",
      "text": "无须多言，自当全力以赴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000234:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f47d75ea4890ad53b17814e939f36d2f3fb7d6975448e8842dc8e785e6c84d7",
      "text": "明天就拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000237:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c75283967fcdeb168c37f8bbd631c1ea54aa98cfb5848203d5a5d09b3aa6417",
      "text": "嗯，交给我吧。\n我会展现出帅气的一面的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000239:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea468bcc0c09ded138d76ebaba702e88db72c9d90fc48cfae83393cc0cec26fe",
      "text": "百百人前辈居然没发表情包\n真少见呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000241:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af287e84ddd222c2744d4f976f703d3494e39dcfd99dc39bdad88b680fa276d8",
      "text": "经你这么一说确实如此。\n是发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000243:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2eece9e2cb8237565973d4abbcd7750e61c040f2a9f80923bcc81040e7f9370",
      "text": "遇上了一点开心的事。\n可能有点兴奋过头了吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000245:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0083bc37d5a40901d91a145f7f9e54bffb3da5978f0ae2b79ee337eda315ca",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000247:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50abfc2e10b130050ecad95568ac1dec4b0ec5fcf19f53ed0aa3face580cb4da",
      "text": "明天会有许多相关人士到场。\n为了迎战演唱会拍摄，\n今天早点休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_h:cmd-000249:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d0f7475c639be93747632a6f7e5636b87c20c978fae19831e45ae85d6c5bf51",
      "text": "好的。\n那就明天现场见",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4",
      "text": "演唱会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b341d6bfd73f23edd4bb9b53133c4bc635dd73e962223f2f06ecce9fba11180e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n我们这边邀请的人，全都来了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b8e84277ec59c969eeab025639404925b2a0d50a1377f1a03eeb3f9b17d14f7",
      "text": "大家都是演艺圈或是各个业界的相关人士吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c965a763983d3d8ab7ee4c0a028c0b25557f16718da601b94576021b38912cef",
      "text": "是的。只是人数比预想中还要多……\n我想锐心先生应该已经察觉到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c35e73c70e8c71a592541fa46dce60dc3d8caa0e4890542b1005b349b4f23147",
      "text": "啊啊。是指会场深处的那批观众吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000071:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31eb3afc7daee0df1d169aa1b16f4f2dfb7e2c6b3afe8d1d3c5d844698360c03",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，我进来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea6d586a1d59a47caeb452b22236632ab4142a443c678f741db6f99d9a74427c",
      "text": "……嗯，这份名单是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f915df4774132952d4b750b672c77a449a653afffef65cc94d5cb6df85eeff7c",
      "text": "是我们演唱会的观众名单吗。\n……上面列着不少眼熟的名字啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9aed044cb16f1416ad07c51d1b86c747f56311edf1bf2f273fb194be4cea429",
      "text": "（这些是……透过父母见过几次面的、\n演艺界的大人物们）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:902f6e9647c0682e449ee83e6581ea211eb3a1bd12222e2a5368e3f711518337",
      "text": "（是315 Production邀请的吗？\n不，事务所应该没有这层人脉才对……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e91d9ad29106a490ce474a97df6d406f8aee669981091500dd946fc865e6480",
      "text": "（恐怕是听说我要在这家事务所作为偶像出道，\n对方主动接触过来的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:677a8588f2fe80089b3fc229350631ec31f122bf844ba34811816404a9b36af7",
      "text": "辛苦了，锐心先生。\n让您久等……啊，那份名单是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab427d3c0e361428bf0acc5e0eab885e04f388af802c833606ff3cafaa959694",
      "text": "抱歉，我不自觉就拿起来看了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81431287dfe0d077cfb484354ba5060109980c7a9227c2ea1711b0d9272d85cb",
      "text": "没事的，请别在意。这本来也是打算在今天\n拿给大家过目的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_i:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8215824e745c946e6ba6791fceb4bacab621ebbc19f4638c170c29c4572e9734",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n观众就确定是名单上的这些人了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef2238608835809ac35b5abf58de7d84391b97590868de34833fcc773ffcd245",
      "text": "不，那份名单只是申请者的名单，\n还没有最终决定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc2e200f7b6ec660a00fcba7b71235b680c47e2c26b12f81c6df545b2c53f57",
      "text": "如果想跟业界建立起深厚的人脉关系，\n确实是一批应当邀请的阵容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3256b9abea525ee588c08e3bc492efc256d49bd97479f29ed6152cb583a72e74",
      "text": "是的。从这次演唱会的目的来看，\n按理说是应该发出邀请的，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17f54b44a8831ca00ef28f1d7034e68a770f24b3a9042797d745f8cde6eb0854",
      "text": "对于说过想在315 Production检验自身实力的\n锐心先生来说，我认为这未必是件好事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1732d91d85318186eec4f3b31c92b7312c15d08348231b3877bc744cc3536ed",
      "text": "（在那之后，我告诉制作人“按照对315 Production和C.FIRST\n最好的方向去决定就好”……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:695e9b46bee20809e6f1061e9df2061d57af82821aec872db0197cc5cae205af",
      "text": "（●●●●プロデューサー判断这样做对我没有好处，\n便没有邀请一部分申请者。但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a697f53b5d1cbc975bc99f6efe0cd41d62ce75dde6f1cf0e5041b7bc233376c",
      "text": "秀、百百人。那些人是跟我有关的业界人士。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68c4f871a43fd2f615d69427e3f41d7d2c84899b94a883e93f17273bab26b43b",
      "text": "名单上并没有他们的名字，\n对制作人来说也是预料之外的观众。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cc08c99984fd1b34c6037690a0955f68c5961e2e77d7b35aa89dc50cd702184",
      "text": "……是我能力不足，非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ea7054fb6f0dc9304cb56fc4ea6a2c7511dd45aa028803b8e09a216a52ae607",
      "text": "……原来是这么回事啊。\n谢谢你，锐心前辈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2168c88a643083f46b1f86f895b7e483ec4741c725e93ef4d0879562891d141",
      "text": "多亏了前辈，我们才能向比预期中\n还要多的人展示我们的厉害之处，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de7d6ec63d33084b453fa6d3dc6c2e22679844da8258968c8ff2c7acd8c10ccd",
      "text": "就是说呀。所以P酱，别道歉啦。\n今天的我们，一定会作为骑士好好努力一番的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fa96feacded382341a8a6d967ae389d815f9c17bf9c4a13a07b27d69cc1d240",
      "text": "你就在那里，给我好好见证这个历史性的瞬间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51627337e467f6c22939a47511d30209df0160db8d50eea850833a8344ce22ca",
      "text": "时间差不多了呢……\n那我们出发咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000128:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40080583766ea198270ffa605fccd42e15b6bbdeb7d1f11b3ac57e1b92a5b2e0",
      "text": "好的，路上小心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_j:cmd-000128:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f8641af04e7ddbd1db4b225015cd3a18f0bc5ae8b6cf00f7131f2c5d921abe3",
      "text": "那么，正式开拍！\n3、2、1……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d676a0ca97f75632341a4fd18aeeaecffe116d909514e7b82374e39cd94fe291",
      "text": "我们就是改变世界的组合——C.FIRST！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86b0a1f223dd96e7d61a6a8d09e2dc6c92e281a635afbb0629b3de1f268beb2e",
      "text": "（就算单靠我一个人很难拿到100分，只要3个人一起\n拿到1000分，就能让P酱开心了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97e98bc873566be0e2f4014d0d34231220336aef3e08da7ea2294829e37a6f1f",
      "text": "（在这家事务所，由我们3个人。\n展现出最顶尖的表演，去超越100分！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:256b5b0487fd012cab11314c98afcb66e0a0460df84d2156aa19281e30ca70e8",
      "text": "（大家的表现，比彩排的时候还要好得多。\n这样的话，绝对能展现出超越1000分的成果！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ca96035e6eaedefa80e7aa44c39dd15cb27ee0bc75937ea214bd05cb7409d0b",
      "text": "百百人前辈、锐心前辈！\n你们应该还不止这点能耐吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0798cf18fc3424cb64e9c6a7dd02e5e84a906cad66ade5419ae74cdd748aebe5",
      "text": "让我们来证明，\n只要是我们就能开辟出任何道路吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d109c53f6743720ebd44e6d002b7eb6c854c97b66e99a4df77361386f4a42a5",
      "text": "（3人每次展现表演，\n相关人士们的眼神就变得愈发闪亮，神情也愈发热切）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10001_01:1_3_10001_01_k:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26d46ac7ede3f0e67f7dee65fdef31ca21d94751897750e28036129a7fd90f52",
      "text": "（毫无疑问。C.FIRST也是一个\n能够成为顶尖偶像的组合！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
